{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:17 2026-09-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:17 2026-09-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:17 2026-09-09 HKT</p><p>今晚快活谷第二場四班一六五○米，潘頓棄騎上季尾騎開的「追風」，今場揀騎「勁進駒」，結果順利為後駒取勝，取得在港第二捷。</p><p>賽後練馬師呂健威說：「『勁進駒』上季一直由潘頓騎開，潘頓是冠軍騎師，他想騎此馬，我當然願意把該駒帥權交給他。『勁進駒』上季不時排外檔，有點欠運，牠常常負重磅，牠又需要擺前走，如果檔位不好，浪費馬匹的體力。此馬的實力已經見盡，但勝在夠忠心，常常跑得接近，今場贏馬後，升上三班，仍然有得爭。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/98f43068de27397b7dc8f6cbf54a7c95/2026-09/1e90c7a0-b02b-4d40-b286-78d278a7c452.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ef2c6030799c38970bb5ea2fe5fb5098/2026-09/3e28fb96-4118-43db-be8e-9691c8a41d8a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7d9296417aeeacac71b00c846edca540/2026-09/16c0f6f9-3442-446a-8808-3e22bbec9711.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9b939dc6fea868277b70a8fc53e480d/2026-09/2964aa75-1cf5-4919-9b03-bc0223ef7874.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/833abdd084b9ce0fe80fada02c27fe3d/2026-09/548143cf-5a9a-4389-ba5e-75546ac375de.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/446aec9e8da7df89033e645d77f0b765/2026-09/63395152-9957-4b43-8eab-a54448e79a1a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6654fc28f9d38309b956656ebe89b3e0/2026-09/a9b77e7c-7209-4640-b6d2-074c6adbdbaa.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fabcfcb8c078b7df5b0f33447afdb713/2026-09/caac9d0c-f2f7-4966-834d-fb185289a37f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0e05e8e5babe0c51cdcf18aae01a13fd/2026-09/d9b01595-d6ef-45ef-bba1-e25c8746eefc.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T12:39:35.395313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}